// Title: MSSQL XPCmdshell Suspicious Execution
// ID: 7f103213-a04e-4d59-8261-213dddf22314
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-07-12
// Tags: attack.execution
// Description: Detects when the MSSQL "xp_cmdshell" stored procedure is used to execute commands
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(where(Provider_Name ICONTAINS "MSSQL") AND where(EventID = "33205") AND (where(Data ICONTAINS "object_name:xp_cmdshell") AND where(Data ICONTAINS "statement:EXEC")))
